  "description": "Proportional-symbol map of rainbow bee-eater records in two-degree squares for the chosen season, with the opposite season drawn as hollow rings. Circle area represents count, on one fixed scale; moving between seasons, each circle grows or shrinks and changes colour.",
  "params": [
    {
      "name": "phase",
      "value": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "season",
      "expr": "['Summer','Autumn','Winter','Spring'][round(phase)%4]"
    }
  ],
